ing and i was like oh  i'll get to learn how real animation is  made while it wasn't familiar to shaffer  this kind of filming process has been  seen before it's also like  essentially the same thing as making a  marvel movie or something in terms of  production bringing chip and dale rescue  rangers to life required many of the  same processes including previz  animation and all that magic and while  schaefer had never done it before he was  up for the challenge and cut that's a  wrap folks who doesn't love a dose of  nostalgia with a brand new spin on it  the team behind it put all kinds of  heart into it and have made animation  world dreams come true we are here for  it which was your favorite cameo  included in chip and dale rescue rangers  [Music]
 

